  "KODIMALI Manage is for agents and administrators only. Use an account with the correct permissions.": "KODIMALI Manage ni ya mawakala na wasimamizi pekee. Tumia akaunti yenye ruhusa sahihi.",
  "KODIMALI advertising is clearly labelled, measurable and designed around useful marketplace discovery.": "Matangazo ya KODIMALI yanatambulika wazi, yanaweza kupimwa na husaidia wateja kupata mali na huduma.",
  "KODIMALI connects customers with verified owners, managers, or agents and provides tools for discovery, booking, payment, and service tracking. Unless a transaction states otherwise, KODIMALI is not the asset owner or a party to the rental agreement.": "KODIMALI huunganisha wateja na wamiliki, mameneja au mawakala waliothibitishwa, na kutoa zana za kutafuta, kufanya booking, kulipa na kufuatilia huduma. Isiposemwa wazi kwenye muamala, KODIMALI si mmiliki wa mali wala mhusika wa mkataba wa upangishaji.",
  "KODIMALI could not start": "KODIMALI haikuweza kuanza",
  "KODIMALI does not publish referrals directly. We verify the property and owner permission first. Rewards depend on eligibility and a completed deal.": "KODIMALI haichapishi taarifa moja kwa moja. Tunathibitisha mali na ruhusa ya mmiliki kwanza. Zawadi hutegemea taarifa kustahili na makubaliano kukamilika.",
  "KODIMALI helps customers discover rentals and connect with agents, but customers should verify the asset and agreement before paying a rent deposit.": "KODIMALI husaidia wateja kupata mali za kukodisha na kuwasiliana na mawakala. Mteja anapaswa kuthibitisha mali na makubaliano kabla ya kulipa amana ya kodi.",
  "KODIMALI home": "KODIMALI mwanzo",
  "KODIMALI may review, restrict, or remove an account, listing, or transaction to protect users. Report a problem through KODIMALI support with the booking reference, payment evidence, and relevant details.": "KODIMALI inaweza kukagua, kuzuia au kuondoa akaunti, mali au muamala ili kulinda watumiaji. Ripoti tatizo kupitia msaada wa KODIMALI ukiambatanisha booking reference, uthibitisho wa malipo na maelezo muhimu.",
