  "KODIMALI ranks public listing areas using approximate distance. Exact property coordinates are shared only through a legitimate viewing process.": "KODIMALI hupanga maeneo ya mali kwa makadirio ya umbali. Mahali kamili pa mali hushirikiwa kupitia utaratibu halali wa kutazama mali pekee.",
