  "Jisajili kama wakala wa ukumbi": "Register as hall agent",
  "Jisajili kwanza kama wakala. Super Admin kisha anakuteua kuwa msimamizi na kukupangia eneo. Ingia tena na ufungue Manage > Mawakala ili kusimamia timu yako.": "Register as an agent first. Super Admin then appoints you as a supervisor and assigns your territory. Sign in again and open Manage > Agents to supervise your team.",
