  "Kagua listings, maombi ya wateja na shughuli za soko.": "Review listings, customer requests and marketplace activity.",
  "Kagua mgawanyo uliokokotolewa. Idhini huachia bidhaa na kuunda madeni; haitumi fedha moja kwa moja.": "Review the calculated allocation. Approval releases inventory and creates liabilities; it does not send money automatically.",
