  "Kagua taarifa binafsi, wasiliana na wamiliki, pangia mawakala waliothibitishwa na andika masharti ya zawadi. Idara ya fedha huidhinisha na kurekodi malipo.": "Review private Toa Taarifa submissions, contact owners, assign verified agents and record referral terms. Finance approves and records payouts.",
