  "KODIMALI Manage App inatumika na agent na admin tu. Tumia akaunti iliyopewa ruhusa sahihi.": "KODIMALI Manage is for agents and administrators only. Use an account with the correct permissions.",
  "KODIMALI haichapishi taarifa moja kwa moja. Tunathibitisha mali na ruhusa ya mmiliki kwanza. Zawadi hutegemea taarifa kustahili na makubaliano kukamilika.": "KODIMALI does not publish referrals directly. We verify the property and owner permission first. Rewards depend on eligibility and a completed deal.",
  "KODIMALI haichapishi taarifa ya referral moja kwa moja. Tunathibitisha mali na ruhusa ya mmiliki kwanza. Zawadi hutegemea lead kustahili na deal kukamilika.": "KODIMALI does not publish referrals directly. We verify the property and owner permission first. Rewards depend on eligibility and a completed deal.",
  "KODIMALI hupanga maeneo ya mali kwa makadirio ya umbali. Mahali kamili pa mali hushirikiwa kupitia utaratibu halali wa kutazama mali pekee.": "KODIMALI ranks public listing areas using approximate distance. Exact property coordinates are shared only through a legitimate viewing process.",
  "KODIMALI husaidia wateja kupata mali za kukodisha na kuwasiliana na mawakala. Mteja anapaswa kuthibitisha mali na makubaliano kabla ya kulipa amana ya kodi.": "KODIMALI helps customers discover rentals and connect with agents, but customers should verify the asset and agreement before paying a rent deposit.",
  "KODIMALI huunganisha wateja na wamiliki, mameneja au mawakala waliothibitishwa, na kutoa zana za kutafuta, kufanya booking, kulipa na kufuatilia huduma. Isiposemwa wazi kwenye muamala, KODIMALI si mmiliki wa mali wala mhusika wa mkataba wa upangishaji.": "KODIMALI connects customers with verified owners, managers, or agents and provides tools for discovery, booking, payment, and service tracking. Unless a transaction states otherwise, KODIMALI is not the asset owner or a party to the rental agreement.",
  "KODIMALI inaweza kukagua, kuzuia au kuondoa akaunti, listing au muamala ili kulinda watumiaji. Ripoti tatizo kupitia msaada wa KODIMALI ukiambatanisha booking reference, uthibitisho wa malipo na maelezo muhimu.": "KODIMALI may review, restrict, or remove an account, listing, or transaction to protect users. Report a problem through KODIMALI support with the booking reference, payment evidence, and relevant details.",
  "KODIMALI inaweza kukagua, kuzuia au kuondoa akaunti, mali au muamala ili kulinda watumiaji. Ripoti tatizo kupitia msaada wa KODIMALI ukiambatanisha booking reference, uthibitisho wa malipo na maelezo muhimu.": "KODIMALI may review, restrict, or remove an account, listing, or transaction to protect users. Report a problem through KODIMALI support with the booking reference, payment evidence, and relevant details.",
