  "Kama akaunti iliundwa bila recovery email, reset ya email haitatumika. Ukiwa umeingia unaweza kutumia change password, au tumia msaada wa admin hapa chini.": "If your account has no recovery email, email reset is unavailable. Signed-in users can change their password, or contact an administrator below.",
