  "Kiasi kamili, madhumuni ya malipo, muda na listing vitaonyeshwa kabla ya kuidhinisha ombi la mobile money. Mfumo huzuia booking mbili zinazogongana kwa muda mmoja. Viewing ni hiari na si sharti la kufanya booking.": "The full amount, payment purpose, period, and listing are shown before you approve the mobile-money request. The system prevents overlapping bookings. A viewing is optional and is not required to book.",
