  "Kwa listing inayoruhusu instant booking, booking inathibitishwa baada ya deposit kuthibitishwa. Reservation ambayo haijalipiwa inaweza kuisha ili muda urudi kupatikana.": "For an instant-bookable listing, the booking is confirmed after the deposit is verified. An unpaid reservation may expire so the period becomes available again.",
