  "Kwa mpango wa tukio wenye watoa huduma wengi, makadirio ya bei na mbadala wowote huwasilishwa kwanza. Makubaliano, amana au malipo huanza tu baada ya mteja kuona na kukubali maelezo husika.": "For a multi-provider event plan, the quotation and any substitutions are presented first. An agreement, deposit, or payment begins only after the customer sees and accepts the relevant details.",
