  "Taarifa hutumiwa kufikisha maombi, kulinda soko, kufungua mawasiliano, kusaidia watumiaji, kuzuia udanganyifu na kutimiza wajibu wa kisheria. Taarifa binafsi za mmiliki, mahali kamili na nyaraka za uhakiki hazichapishwi kwenye orodha ya umma.": "Information is used to deliver requests, protect the marketplace, process contact access, support users, prevent fraud, and meet legal obligations. Private owner details, exact locations, and verification documents are not part of the public listing feed.",
