  "Taarifa za mmiliki (si lazima na ni za faragha)": "Owner details (optional and private)",
  "Taarifa za ombi la mteja zinaweza kujumuisha jina, simu, barua pepe, tarehe, huduma, ujumbe, utambulisho wa akaunti na historia ya hali ya ombi.": "Customer request details can include name, phone, email, requested dates, requested services, messages, account identity, and status history.",
  "Taarifa za tukio": "Event details",
