  "Taarifa za wakala zinaweza kujumuisha akaunti, wasifu wa biashara, simu, eneo, nyaraka za uhakiki, mali, kumbukumbu za wamiliki na shughuli za kazi.": "Agent information can include account details, business profile, phone, location, identity-verification documents, listings, owner records, and operational activity.",
  "Taarifa za wasifu wa umma na vitambulisho vya kuingia vitaondolewa au kufichwa utambulisho inapowezekana. Baadhi ya kumbukumbu za malipo, kuzuia udanganyifu, migogoro, ukaguzi au sheria zinaweza kuhifadhiwa kwa muda unaohitajika huku ufikiaji ukizuiwa.": "Public profile data and access credentials will be removed or anonymized where applicable. Some payment, fraud-prevention, dispute, audit, or legal records may be retained for the required period and access restricted.",
